<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister shall appoint, from among members of the public service, a Director General of Sewerage Services."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_III__cl_8> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
