<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "A delegation under subsection (4) is revocable at the discretion of the Director General and does not prevent the Director General or Deputy Director General from exercising the powers or performing the functions delegated under that subsection."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
