<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_1__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "a local authority and the relevant State Government, have mutually agreed to the transfer of any moveable or immoveable property vested in the local authority or the State Government for purposes of sewerage systems and sewerage services, the Minister may by order published in the Gazette appoint a date and on that date the immoveable or moveable property shall be transferred to and vested in the Federal Government in accordance with the terms and conditions mutually agreed to by the parties concerned."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
