<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Where any property, not being State land, vested in a local authority or State Government for purposes of sewerage systems and sewerage services immediately prior to the coming into operation of this Act is needed for those purposes under this Act but no agreement is reached between the parties referred to in subsection ( Ij with respect to the transfer of that property, the property may be acquired by the Federal Government—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
