<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_IV__cl_16> <https://schema.org/name> "The Director General shall cause public sewerage"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_IV__cl_16> <https://schema.org/text> "systems to be properly cleared, cleansed and emptied and, for the purpose of clearing, cleansing and emptying the public sewerage systems, he may construct and place, either above or under ground, such reservoirs, sluices, engines and other works as are necessary."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
