<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_31__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The person to whom any written directions are given under subsection (3) shall amend the plans and specifications accordingly and re-submit the amended plans and specifications within such period or extended period as the Director General may specify."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_31__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_31> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
