<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_V__cl_23__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_V__cl_23__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the person to whom a notice issued under subsection (1) or (2) fails to comply with the notice within the period specified in the notice, the Director General or any person authorised by him may, at the expiration of such period, do the work required in the notice and may recover the expenses incurred in doing so from the owner or occupier."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
