<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_V__cl_24__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Director General may issue a notice in accordance with this Act to the owner, or if the owner cannot with reasonable diligence be traced the occupier, of any premises not connected to a public sewerage system requiring the owner or occupier to construct or lay for the premises, within the period specified in the notice, a private connection pipe of such materials or size and at such level as to enable the premises to be properly and effectively connected to any public sewer or public sewerage system located within thirty meters from the boundary of the premises."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
