<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_36__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_36__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "When any notice under this Act or any regulations made under this Act requires any act to be done or work to be executed by the owner or occupier of any premises and the owner or occupier fails to comply with the requirements of the notice, the owner or occupier shall be guilty of an offence and shall, on conviction, where no fine is specially provided, be liable to a fine not exceeding five thousand ringgit and to a further fine not exceeding five hundred ringgit for each day that the offence continues after conviction."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_36__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_36> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_36__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_36__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_36__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Where any notice requires any act to be done or work to be executed for which no time is fixed by this Act or any regulation made under this Act, it shall fix a reasonable time for complying with the requirement."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
