<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_40> <https://schema.org/name> "The Director General, or any officer appointed"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_40> <https://schema.org/text> "under section 8 to whom the Director General has delegated the power in writing, may in his discretion compound any offence against this Act or any regulation made under this Act which has been prescribed to be a compoundable offence by collecting from the person reasonably suspected of having committed the offence a sum of money not exceeding the maximum fine prescribed for that offence."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
