<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_41__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Service of a document on any person shall be effected—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_41__subsec_1__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_41__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
