<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_41__subsec_1__para_a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_41__subsec_1__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "by delivering the document to that person or by delivering the document at the last known place of residence of that person to an adult member of his family;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_41__subsec_1__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_41__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
