<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_42__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "No proceedings taken under or by virtue of this Act or any regulation made under this Act shall be invalid for want of form."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
