<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_44__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_44__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Nothing in this Act shall affect the liability of the purchaser or transferee to pay costs and expenses in respect of the property referred to in subsection (1) or affect the right of the Director General or a sewerage services contractor or a connection contractor, as the case may be, to recover those costs and expenses from or to enforce any obligation under this Act against the purchaser or transferee."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
