<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_46__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Nothing shall affect the past operation of, or anything done under the provisions of, any law relating to sewerage systems and services passed before the date of coming into operation of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
