<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_46__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any plans or specifications in respect of any sewerage system or septic tank approved under any other written law before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall be deemed to have been approved under section 31."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_46__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_46> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
