<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_46__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The provisions of subsections 32(1) and (2) shall not apply to any person who, on the date of coming into operation of this Act, was carrying on any of the acts described in subsection 32(1) until the expiration of six months from that date or the final determination of his application for a licence under this Act, whichever is the later."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/15/eng@> .
